      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "// For each neighbors\ninterface {name}\n    ip address {ip}\nexit\n\ninterface lo\n    ip address {loopback}\nexit\n\nrouter bgp {as-number}\n no bgp ebgp-requires-policy // Shouldn't be done in prod\n bgp router-id {loopback}\n neighbor SPINE peer-group\n neighbor SPINE remote-as 65000\n neighbor 10.0.0.1 peer-group SPINE\n neighbor 10.0.0.2 peer-group SPINE\n\naddress-family ipv4 unicast\n neighbor SPINE activate\n network {loopback}/32\n maximum-paths 2\nexit\n\naddress-family l2vpn evpn\n neighbor SPINE activate\n advertise-all-vni\n// For each vni\n vni {vni}\n rd {loopback} {vni}\n route-target import 65000:{vni}\n route\n ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "cyqzwZwJl2m67uHvkhVcd",
